OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,6,Fwill gradually clear by mid-morning to
OL,7,Fgive another fine day, with variable
OL,8,Fcloud and bright or sunny spells.
OL,9,FTemperatures still above average.
OL,10,FLight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain,
OL,13,Flocally heavy, gradually clearing
OL,14,Fsoutheast Wednesday. Mostly dry with
OL,15,Fsunny spells Thursday, after a chilly
OL,16,Fstart. A few coastal showers.
OL,17,FBreezier, with rain spreading east
OL,18,FFriday. Temperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
